<title>POLAND: NBP OFFERS TO SELL PLN 500 MLN OF NBP-BILLS.</title>
<headline>NBP OFFERS TO SELL PLN 500 MLN OF NBP-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland</p>
<p>offered to sell 100 million zlotys of its 91-day NBP-bills and</p>
<p>400 million zlotys of 273-day NBP-bills, teh central bank said.</p>
<p>    Deadline hour		 - 12:00</p>
<p>    Date of settlement	  - Jan 24, 1997</p>
<p>Maturity of bills offered - Apr 25, 1997, Oct 24, 1997</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
